The legacy ZIP's optional Microsoft Store bootstrap makes a private local working copy
from the current user's installed GIMP. It does not download or redistribute
that copy as part of this release, change GIMP binaries, or alter Windows
security settings. That local copy is excluded from release archives.

The new store/ native frontend does not use this legacy bootstrap or copy GIMP.
Its MSIX contains only the frontend, GIMP worker script, assets and license notices.
